{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "%lld 份资料 · %lld 题 · %lld 场会议": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld files · %lld questions · %lld meetings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "English": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "English"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上午好": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Good morning"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下午好": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Good afternoon"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下面是用 ScreenCaptureKit 截取整个屏幕的结果，与 Zoom / Teams / Meet 等共享整屏时的取图方式相同。如果能看到提词器，说明共享整屏时对方也可能看到；请改为只共享会议窗口或标签页。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is the whole screen captured with ScreenCaptureKit, the way Zoom, Teams or Meet capture a shared screen. If you can see the teleprompter here, others may see it when you share your entire screen; share only the meeting window or tab instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "产品资料、报价": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Product materials, pricing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会中自动给出回答 · 回答简短 · 会后复盘并存进题库": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Answers appear automatically · Brief answers · Review afterwards, saved to the question bank"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会中自动给出回答 · 回答简短 · 纪要：需求、顾虑、我们答应的、下一步": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Answers appear automatically · Brief answers · Notes: needs, concerns, what we promised, next steps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会中自动给出回答，跟着讲稿 · 回答简短 · 纪要：听众问了什么、怎么答更好": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Answers appear automatically, follows your slides · Brief answers · Notes: what the audience asked and better answers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会议 %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meetings %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会议进行中不能切换语言。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can't change the language during a meeting."
          }
        }
      }
    },
